ajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"a1u9Bxrq_fZxl2pgqQUcJA","review_id":"tN6i8MqCcQ9oI2AuNgTnyw","date":"2018-09-18T23:59:25","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9361550211906433,"text_excerpt":"Circumstances brought my friend and I here, but both us of were so glad we did! Okay, so full disclosure: this wasn't our first choice. We wanted to eat next door but there was a wait. My friend didn't want to wait so we looked here and were like, \"okay, sure\". We were greeted by the most lovely host who took us up to their second floor and sat us near a window. It was a rainy day, but it was still nice to sit and look out the window, even if all you saw were raindrops. So we ordered our breakfast. Naturally, I went big and got the Governor's breakfast: Three eggs cooked medium, bacon, pork sausage (patty), andouille sausage link (NOLA loves it's andouille sausage), choice of two sides an..."},{"business_id":"a1u9Bxrq_fZxl2pgqQUcJA","review_id":"e1wJMPBguovcsqfTTCTvHg","date":"2018-12-05T02:48:25","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9283966422080994,"text_excerpt":"Had a wonderful late lunch here, they are in a really nice corner in French Qtr. They have a good variety of Cajun Creole food and the food is very good and decently priced. Service is very friendly, and they have a good number of tables as well as a bar that you can order food and drinks and watch the game. For an appetizer we ordered the deviled eggs, which was really good as they also included caviar and a fried oyster, which was crazy and amazing. Highly recommend. I ordered the duck and andouille sasuage gumbo, which was as rich and tasty as it sounds. Duck is an excellent addition to gumbo and I don't know why more places don't offer that. The smokiness of the sausages and the flavo..."},{"business_id":"a1u9Bxrq_fZxl2pgqQUcJA","review_id":"xHaiYXIQBRIP5snnsTmRjg","date":"2019-07-17T00:09:12","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9278619885444641,"text_excerpt":"This is a new place that I've been wanting to try. The overall experience was enjoyable. Our waitress, Trevor, (female) was pleasant, knowledgeable, sweet, funny, and attentive. The main reason why we came here is because she loves raw oysters (Pictured below). They were pretty small in size, however, those are the type that she likes. After reading all the positive reviews about the deviled eggs (Pictured below), we had to try them. I guess being a local, I don't get the \"wow\" factor as easily as others. At first they tasted a bit bland, so adding some salt and Crystal hot sauce made them more tasty. I also got the shrimp crab cakes (Pictured below). It comes with their homemade remoulad..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"a1u9Bxrq_fZxl2pgqQUcJA","photo_id":"uXB5ktfOLuA9DEfA6_RIRA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/uXB5ktfOLuA9DEfA6_RIRA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8276252150535583},{"business_id":"a1u9Bxrq_fZxl2pgqQUcJA","photo_id":"7xvWFM3kS3QhM9Lz7ChsFg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/7xvWFM3kS3QhM9Lz7ChsFg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8220696449279785},{"business_id":"a1u9Bxrq_fZxl2pgqQUcJA","photo_id":"JmcYI1sl7p5_E2bTD0kO-Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/JmcYI1sl7p5_E2bTD0kO-Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8028481602668762},{"business_id":"a1u9Bxrq_fZxl2pgqQUcJA","photo_id":"7OaSrYL00XHia1cnefPklg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/7OaSrYL00XHia1cnefPklg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7432059049606323},{"business_id":"a1u9Bxrq_fZxl2pgqQUcJA","photo_id":"a0E8gL5yeZrtGV0skNXjwg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/a0E8gL5yeZrtGV0skNXjwg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.6888308525085449}]},"notebook_case":null}
